---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, href } from '../consts';
---

<Layout title="Contact, Opson" description="How to reach the people who make Opson.">
  <article class="page">
    <div class="wrap">
      <header class="page-head">
        <h1>Contact</h1>
        <p>Opson is made by Nightjar Labs. Email is the best way to reach us.</p>
      </header>

      <a class="mail" href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>
        <span class="mail-label">Email</span>
        <span class="mail-address">{CONTACT_EMAIL}</span>
      </a>

      <div class="prose notes">
        <p>Good things to write about: a bug, a food that's missing or wrong, a mode that doesn't fit how you eat, or anything about your data.</p>
        <p>
          To come off the waitlist, say so and we'll delete your address. To delete your Opson account and log, you can
          do it in the app under More, then Support and sharing, then Delete everything, or ask us and we'll do it.
        </p>
        <p>The <a href={href('/privacy/')}>privacy page</a> has the details on what we keep.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .mail {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 26px 28px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 2px solid transparent;
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }
  .mail:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .mail-label { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; }
  .mail-address { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(20px, 4vw, 26px); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
</style>
